# Security checking

Read **`security_best_practices_report.md`** before HTTP, auth, or validation-limit edits.

## OAuth

- Only **`GSC_READONLY_SCOPE`** in `src/config.ts`. No extra scopes without README + report update.

## HTTP

- Default **`127.0.0.1`**. No default **`0.0.0.0`**.
- No MCP-layer auth on HTTP — bind address matters.
- Keep **`MAX_HTTP_BODY_BYTES`** (4 MB) and **`MAX_HTTP_SESSIONS`** (32).

## Errors and secrets

- Users see **`sanitizeToolError`** only. Logs use **`formatErrorForLog`**.
- Never commit credentials, service account JSON, or secret `.env`.

## Dependencies

- After lockfile changes: **`npm audit --audit-level=high`**.

## Ask first

- Loosening HTTP caps, widening scopes, or exposing HTTP without extra controls.
